  <UserdefinedSymbols />
  <Comments>Original implementation. DrummerIX reference CT was read for context only; addresses and machine instructions were independently checked in the running game. No third-party scripts are embedded. Enable parent first. All features require gameplay testing. Disable children before parent, and disable everything before closing Cheat Engine. Gil changes remain after disabling. SP options share hooks and can be combined. XP and level changes become visible after battle, when back on the field. User confirmed foundation scripts work in gameplay on 2026-10-10. Other requested battle/capture/item features are not yet implemented.</Comments>
</CheatTable>